{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/aa9bd6074babcfbacf125e1cfd307505.avif?t=1751975050\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras_big/aa9bd6074babcfbacf125e1cfd307505.avif?t=1751975050 width=800 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Hermit Kingdom, an isolated country under brutal hardship. Here, you must use their secure computer operating system and gather intel on the country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Hermit Computer</i></strong> is a horror-puzzle game set deep within a secretive hermit kingdom. You play as an American operative, captured while covertly gathering intel on the government. Now imprisoned in a high-security facility, your only tool is a restricted, state-run computer system. Use it to uncover secrets, navigate censored networks, and reach out to the U.S. Embassy\u2014all while avoiding detection by patrolling guards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are ears everywhere.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/587eb1675a4d5a258df0dbec48b1469a.poster.avif?t=1751975050\" width=576 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/587eb1675a4d5a258df0dbec48b1469a.webm?t=1751975050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Careful not to be too loud-- there are ears everywhere in the Hermit Kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gather intel.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/822fb1a6437be858a9f4ddc6860e7d3c.poster.avif?t=1751975050\" width=576 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/822fb1a6437be858a9f4ddc6860e7d3c.webm?t=1751975050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and take pictures of all the secrets found on the computer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crack the puzzle.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/883f1245cf9ed43d0e9cfcbee41b7aee.poster.avif?t=1751975050\" width=576 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/extras/883f1245cf9ed43d0e9cfcbee41b7aee.webm?t=1751975050\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be deterred by some passwords.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638070?t=1751975050","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638070?t=1751975050","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/20e75cc23243a6e240d799ab5b8fb120fd4c7fff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751975050","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638070/20e75cc23243a6e240d799ab5b8fb120fd4c7fff/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751975050","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_descr